)" || fail installed_schema_contract_unreadable 'The disposable schema ledger could not be read.' 'Inspect the shipped schema installer and PostgreSQL target runtime.'
expected_schema_contract="ishikawa_consolidated_schema_v5|${application_schema_sha256}|5"
